John:

The jumpers reside under the hard disk, adjacent to the SCSI controller,
they are unlabeled. 

AFAIK the positions are: W6 W3
                         W5 W4
Settings as follows:

w6 w5 w4 w3   vert. refresh  Pixel Freq 
0  0   0  0   59.94          25.175 
0  0   0  1   72.79          31.50 
0  0   1  0   60.32          40.00 
0  0   1  1   72.19          50.00 
0  1   0  0   70.07          75.00 
0  1   0  1   70.033         74.367 
0  1   1  0   60.00          70.00 
0  1   1  1   60.1          110.15 
1  0   0  0   66.51         119.843 
1  0   0  1   72.556        130.808 
1  0   1  0   72.05         130.08 

You are limited to 8bit graphics, so only 256 colors.
On both of my Multias, the factory settings was W5 & W4 jumpered.

Good luck!!

