> and discovered that there was only one file in SYMVAX$DUA0:[SYSEXE],
> which was SYSBOOT.EXE. Now, it's been while since I've played with
> VMS, and I don't have much of any documenation, so I can't recall what
> files should be in DUA0:[SYSEXE], but something tells me more than one
