Ivan,

If your Adaptec has 'Ctrl-A for SCSISelect' firmware at power up, you can
configure the controller to issue a spin up command. IIRC, if it's a 1540/1542,
it needs to be revision B or later, while all 2940 series have this facility.
Also, it's possible that this message is suppressed, type Ctrl-A after the
initial Adaptec message, but before it says bios loaded.

Rgrds, Chris



