You want 72 pin, 70ns (or faster) 4MB parity (x36) SIMMs.

The brand doesn't seem to be important.  I have used IBM, DATARAM, and
Siemens in addition to Digital memory.

You need to add memory in pairs.  You can only use 4MB SIMMs.  24MB is
the maximum memory.

Good luck!

