From: Neil Crellin <neilc@wallaby.cc>
Subject: 2nd CFV: comp.unix.tru64
Date: 2000/03/09
Message-ID: <952633606.10425@isc.org>
X-Deja-AN: 595309271
Expires: 21 Mar 2000 00:00:00 GMT
Approved: newgroups-request@isc.org
References: <948453625.2344@isc.org> <948505232.5024@isc.org> <950056469.11699@isc.org> <951754496.10362@isc.org>
Supersedes: <951754496.10362@isc.org>
Followup-To: poster
