Hi,

Clustering is provided for critical application to be available during
unusual faliover.Like if your one system goes down where this
software/application is running then other can take over this application
and for endusers this application will be continous available.

Now if you want it to continous available then,
Install your software on both the nodes nut run that one copy at a time on
any node.
Configure your application as a continous available application through
"asemgr".

End users will be using this application through Application IP alias.

