The Comet is what you in the non-Digital world would call a Elsa Gloria
Synergy.

They come with either 4 or 8 MB RAM. The processor is a Permedia 2, and
it'll do up to 1600x1200 in up to 24 bit, if you have the required
amount of RAM.

