Hi Phillip,

Yes you can add more external disks to the narrow scsi bus port in the
back.  The way we have been doing here on AST 200 is by using BA353(pizza
box), which will give you 3 more slots.

The blue Ultras scsi disk is supposed to work with SCSI-2, but it might not
