Performance is a tricky issue.  It depends on your IO requirements.  I
would try to keep the total bandwidth utilization under 5 MB/sec.  I have
been noticing about 1-2MB/sec per disk under our heavy load, but this is
just our experience.  If you need heavier IO and more storage, you probably
want to move another SCSI controller and 6 disk desktop expension box.

Good luck,
yi

