effective to do a cache large enough to make a difference considering
the L1's size.  Maybe when 16MB or 32MB of L2 is practical....with the
PA-8700 a year from now, perhaps?

Has Compaq announced whether there will be any support for external
cache in the 21364?  Since that'd be a third level, it might not be
enough of a boost to be worth it.

